{"ref":"BDB, גַּרְגְּרוֹת","hw":"גַּרְגְּרוֹת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּרְגְּרוֹת</span></big>  <strong>n.f.pl. neck (</strong>on format. cf. Ba <sup>NB 204</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּרְגְּרֹתֶ֑יךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.9\">Pr 1:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.22\">3:22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּרְגְּרוֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.3\">Pr 3:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּרְגְּרֹתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.21\">6:21</a>—always in fig., instruction of parents an ornament, a chain <em>upon neck</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.9\">Pr 1:9</a>, <em>bind them upon thy neck</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.21\">6:21</a>; so of mercy & truth <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.3\">3:3</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.22\">22</a>.","next":"BDB, מְגֵרָה","prev":"BDB, גַּרְגַּר²"}